---
title: "refund (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_ended: contract not paused
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_state: sale not ended
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_check_timing: sale ended
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_expired: block.timestamp > refundEndTime
    q_revert_expired --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodExpired
    q_check_timing --> q_check_refunded: within refund period
    q_check_refunded --> q_revert_dup: position.hasRefunded == true
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert AlreadyRefunded
    q_check_refunded --> q_get_amount: not yet refunded
    q_get_amount --> q_update: amount = position.investedCapital
    q_update --> q_transfer: position.hasRefunded = true, totalCapitalInvested -= amount
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, amount), emit Refunded

    note right of q_check_timing
        INV-001: refund window from endTime to refundEndTime
        INV-002: refund period duration configured at initialization
    end note
